  "_about": "ESTIMATED list prices in USD per million tokens, used only to estimate cost. Edit freely. A model id is priced by the longest key below that it contains, unless another version number follows the key (claude-opus-4 does not price claude-opus-4-9; a date such as -20250514 is fine). cacheWrite is the 5-minute cache-write rate, cacheWrite1h the 1-hour rate. Subscription plans are not billed per token, so for them this is a notional figure. longContext (optional): rates for a request whose prompt (input + cache writes + cache reads) is over `above` tokens; the whole request is priced at them. claude-haiku-5-5 has one above 100,000 tokens (checked against Anthropic's pricing page 2026-11-22); other current Claude models price the full 1M window at the base rates. Last reviewed 2026-11. OpenAI (Codex CLI) models: input is the uncached input rate, cacheRead the cached-input rate, cacheWrite 0 (OpenAI does not charge for cache writes); the longContext rows are OpenAI's 'long context' (over 272K input tokens) standard rates, taken as over 272,000 tokens, checked against OpenAI's pricing page 2026-11-22; gpt-5.4-mini and gpt-5.4-nano have no long-context price listed.",
